{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_60323C42","title":"Have Dinner with Cale","entry":"Dlg_60323C42::entry","exit":"Dlg_60323C42::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_3500EA2C","articyId":"72057619807815830","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cale Wyer","text":"I can't believe I'm back here. Can't believe I'm actually out of the city! This is incredible.","speakerId":"Ntt_BD75DC29","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I can't believe I'm back here. Can't believe I'm actually out of the city! This is incredible.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":225.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23910","byteOffset":16925864,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_C0227ED0","articyId":"72057619807815849","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cale Wyer","text":"I am. I swear the air smells different out here. Course could be the Corpo bubble they got built over this place, but I'm not gonna tread down that track right now.","speakerId":"Ntt_BD75DC29","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I am. I swear the air smells different out here. Course could be the Corpo bubble they got built over this place, but I'm not gonna tread down that track right now.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":825.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41641","byteOffset":30081488,"byteLength":544}},{"id":"DFr_50BFE8E3","articyId":"72057619807815877","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cale Wyer","text":"Right? And that water is the most beautiful color. Honestly, I never thought I'd see something so... natural... again.","speakerId":"Ntt_BD75DC29","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right? And that water is the most beautiful color. Honestly, I never thought I'd see something so... natural... again.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2600.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21257","byteOffset":15926128,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_13305BBE","articyId":"72057619807815897","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cale Wyer","text":"Well, what do you think of Calypso? It's exactly how I remember it.","speakerId":"Ntt_BD75DC29","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, what do you think of Calypso? It's exactly how I remember it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26993","byteOffset":18091952,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_590A4D5C","articyId":"72057619807815919","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cale Wyer","text":"Agreed. To no corps and no punks. Just people. Cheers.","speakerId":"Ntt_BD75DC29","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Agreed. To no corps and no punks. Just people. Cheers.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49602","byteOffset":33107616,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_44FA421B","articyId":"72057619807815934","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cale Wyer","text":"Oh, sure, there's always things that could be improved, but looking at this place compared to say, the Sewers?","speakerId":"Ntt_BD75DC29","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, sure, there's always things that could be improved, but looking at this place compared to say, the Sewers?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"condition